          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="n4fE8acd2FAlWuIs1wk2-69" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Charakter-Profil: Ferol Sal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Status:&lt;/b&gt; Untoter (Wight) | &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;Sprachen:&lt;/b&gt; Archaisches Draconisch, Archaisches Elfisch (&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;81&quot;&gt;kein&lt;/b&gt; Gemeinsprachig!)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Persönlichkeit &amp;amp; Zustand&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wahnsinn:&lt;/b&gt; Die Jahrhunderte der Isolation und seine Verwandlung haben ihn in den Wahnsinn getrieben. Seine Erinnerungen an die ferne Vergangenheit sind verblasst.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Motivation:&lt;/b&gt; Sein einziger Antrieb ist &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;38&quot;&gt;Rache an den Göttern&lt;/b&gt;. Er geht (fälschlicherweise) davon aus, dass diese in Exandria noch immer aktiv eingreifen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wissensstand:&lt;/b&gt; Er hat keine Ahnung von der Geschichte Exandrias nach dem Absturz von Aeor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Interaktion mit der Gruppe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Erste Reaktion:&lt;/b&gt; Er ist misstrauisch und fordert sofort zu wissen, was die Charaktere in Salsvault zu suchen haben.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Kommunikation:&lt;/b&gt; Da er nur archaische Sprachen spricht, verläuft die Verständigung zäh (langsame Kommunikation für Charaktere mit Draconisch oder Elfisch).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Täuschung (Deception):&lt;/b&gt; Spieler können sein Vertrauen gewinnen, wenn sie behaupten, bei seiner Arbeit helfen zu wollen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mechanik:&lt;/i&gt; Charisma (Täuschung) gegen seinen Weisheit (Motiv erkennen) Wurf.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Vorteil:&lt;/b&gt; Wenn die Spieler die Notiz aus &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,1,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;40&quot;&gt;S10&lt;/b&gt; gelesen haben und seinen Plan erwähnen, eine gott-tötende Seuche zu erschaffen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wichtige Informationen (bei Vertrauen)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Warnung:&lt;/b&gt; Er weist sie an, sich vom Golem-Labor (&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;48&quot;&gt;S16&lt;/b&gt;) fernzuhalten.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Das Heilmittel:&lt;/b&gt; Er bestätigt, dass sich das Heilmittel für &lt;i data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;59&quot;&gt;Frostleid (Frigid Woe)&lt;/i&gt; in einer Truhe im Heilmittel-Labor (&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;118&quot;&gt;S18&lt;/b&gt;) befindet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Der Schlüssel:&lt;/b&gt; Mit einem &lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;DC 15 Charisma (Überzeugen)&lt;/b&gt; Check können die Spieler ihn dazu bringen, ihnen den Schlüssel für die Truhe in S18 auszuhändigen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="640" width="560" x="-860" y="16366" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsKeys&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;60d56f00-4516-4497-99d7-f9212fb6c431&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ferol’s Keys&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;836cdc8c-460b-4a81-a353-230daafc0f66&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ferol carries two keys: one that works all the doors in Salsvault and another that works all the chests built into the floor within the complex (see “&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultFeatures&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;96d0a736-630e-499e-9585-2a818d726d5f&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Salsvault Features&lt;/a&gt;”).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsLaboratoryShelves&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7bd90f09-d359-4c8b-8235-ce3773b8c5c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#FerolsLaboratoryShelves&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;d27b478a-5cd9-49ce-9b3f-e53a5f5e2f85&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Shelves&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;fcef7cef-8657-44e3-a8ca-ac0646d9f8ec&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The shelves hold spell components, reagents, and laboratory supplies that are far past their prime. However, a character who spends a few minutes searching the shelves can collect enough workable tools and reagents to put together a set of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover item-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/equipment/102-alchemists-supplies&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/adventuring-gear/102-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(119, 69, 33) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;alchemist’s supplies&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsLaboratoryTables&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9cf3f551-cd04-401c-96c6-cef12865f9d2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#FerolsLaboratoryTables&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e2f1cf63-d4de-4004-bf80-62740aea2bd2&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Tables&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;97f319ec-55cf-4378-843e-20891a23d653&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Each table holds a working set of alchemist’s supplies that Ferol uses to experiment with frigid woe. If a creature is forcibly moved into a table, the delicate equipment on that table breaks and the creature must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or contract frigid woe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" link="&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsKeys&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;60d56f00-4516-4497-99d7-f9212fb6c431&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ferol’s Keys&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;836cdc8c-460b-4a81-a353-230daafc0f66&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Ferol carries two keys: one that works all the doors in Salsvault and another that works all the chests built into the floor within the complex (see “&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#SalsvaultFeatures&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;96d0a736-630e-499e-9585-2a818d726d5f&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Salsvault Features&lt;/a&gt;”).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsLaboratoryShelves&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;7bd90f09-d359-4c8b-8235-ce3773b8c5c4&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#FerolsLaboratoryShelves&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;d27b478a-5cd9-49ce-9b3f-e53a5f5e2f85&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Shelves&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;fcef7cef-8657-44e3-a8ca-ac0646d9f8ec&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The shelves hold spell components, reagents, and laboratory supplies that are far past their prime. However, a character who spends a few minutes searching the shelves can collect enough workable tools and reagents to put together a set of&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;tooltip-hover item-tooltip&quot; href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/equipment/102-alchemists-supplies&quot; data-tooltip-href=&quot;//www.dndbeyond.com/adventuring-gear/102-tooltip?disable-webm=1&amp;amp;disable-webm=1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(119, 69, 33) !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold !important; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;alchemist’s supplies&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4 id=&quot;FerolsLaboratoryTables&quot; class=&quot;compendium-hr heading-anchor&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;9cf3f551-cd04-401c-96c6-cef12865f9d2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 19.5px 0px 6.5px; font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; scroll-margin-top: 16px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/egtw/adventures-in-wildemount-frozen-sick#FerolsLaboratoryTables&quot; data-content-chunk-id=&quot;e2f1cf63-d4de-4004-bf80-62740aea2bd2&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; color: rgb(0, 106, 190); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Tables&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p data-content-chunk-id=&quot;97f319ec-55cf-4378-843e-20891a23d653&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; width: 850px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(249, 249, 249); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Each table holds a working set of alchemist’s supplies that Ferol uses to experiment with frigid woe. If a creature is forcibly moved into a table, the delicate equipment on that table breaks and the creature must succeed on a DC 11 Constitution saving throw or contract frigid woe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;" id="n4fE8acd2FAlWuIs1wk2-70">
